      "type": "text",
      "x": 1880,
      "y": 968,
      "width": 229.84,
      "height": 21.25,
      "text": "CACHE KEY  &  INVALIDATION",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "CACHE KEY  &  INVALIDATION",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "el64",
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1685254564,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1709696036,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1880,
      "y": 1003,
      "width": 507.0,
      "height": 292.5,
      "text": "key   q:{tenant}:{v}:{sha1(q|filters|page|size|sort)}\n              v = GET inv:{tenant}     the tenant's cache version\n\ninvalidation is one integer:\n\n      indexer finishes a document  ->  INCR inv:acme   7 -> 8\n\nevery future key is now q:acme:8:...   every :7: key is\nunreachable and expires on its own.  no SCAN, no key deletion,\nno fan-out  \u2014  one command voids thousands of cached queries.\n\nL1  in-process LRU, 5 s, with a single-flight guard: 200\n    simultaneous misses on one key send ONE query to\n    Elasticsearch, the other 199 wait on its result.\n\nnever put user_id or session_id in the key unless users inside\na tenant genuinely see different documents.  it would give\nevery user a private cache and collapse the hit rate to zero.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "key   q:{tenant}:{v}:{sha1(q|filters|page|size|sort)}\n              v = GET inv:{tenant}     the tenant's cache version\n\ninvalidation is one integer:\n\n      indexer finishes a document  ->  INCR inv:acme   7 -> 8\n\nevery future key is now q:acme:8:...   every :7: key is\nunreachable and expires on its own.  no SCAN, no key deletion,\nno fan-out  \u2014  one command voids thousands of cached queries.\n\nL1  in-process LRU, 5 s, with a single-flight guard: 200\n    simultaneous misses on one key send ONE query to\n    Elasticsearch, the other 199 wait on its result.\n\nnever put user_id or session_id in the key unless users inside\na tenant genuinely see different documents.  it would give\nevery user a private cache and collapse the hit rate to zero.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "el65",
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1713601029,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1692732590,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "x": 100,
      "y": 1383.5,
      "width": 123.76,
      "height": 21.25,
      "text": "LATENCY BUDGET",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "LATENCY BUDGET",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "el66",
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 444688429,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 2068124765,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "x": 100,
      "y": 1415.5,
      "width": 478.79999999999995,
      "height": 192.5,
      "text": "gateway + TLS            5 ms\nrate limit               1 ms\nL2 Redis                 2 ms\nElasticsearch       60-120 ms   <- the only expensive hop\nserialize                5 ms\n                    ---------\ncache MISS            ~140 ms      budget is 500 ms\ncache HIT              ~10 ms\n\nat 1000 QPS with a 60-70% hit rate, only ~350 QPS ever\nreaches Elasticsearch.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "gateway + TLS            5 ms\nrate limit               1 ms\nL2 Redis                 2 ms\nElasticsearch       60-120 ms   <- the only expensive hop\nserialize                5 ms\n                    ---------\ncache MISS            ~140 ms      budget is 500 ms\ncache HIT              ~10 ms\n\nat 1000 QPS with a 60-70% hit rate, only ~350 QPS ever\nreaches Elasticsearch.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "el67",
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1719888007,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 267352361,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "x": 960,
      "y": 1383.5,
      "width": 176.8,
      "height": 21.25,
      "text": "SHARDING  &  ROUTING",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "SHARDING  &  ROUTING",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "el68",
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 818661758,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 289255806,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "x": 960,
      "y": 1415.5,
      "width": 546.0,
      "height": 297.5,
      "text": "ONE index, N shards, ALL tenants share them.\n\n     shard = hash(tenant_id) % N\n\nevery acme document lands on the same shard, so a search with\nrouting=acme touches only that shard.  different tenants hash to\ndifferent shards, so 1000 QPS still spreads across the cluster.\n\nNOT one shard per tenant  \u2014  1000 tenants would mean thousands of\nshards and a dead cluster.\n\ncost: a whale tenant unbalances its shard.  escape hatches are\nrouting_partition_size, or promoting it to its own index via\ntenants.index_group.\n\nshard count is FIXED at creation  \u2014  hash % N changes if N does.\nresharding = new index, reindex, swap the alias.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ONE index, N shards, ALL tenants share them.\n\n     shard = hash(tenant_id) % N\n\nevery acme document lands on the same shard, so a search with\nrouting=acme touches only that shard.  different tenants hash to\ndifferent shards, so 1000 QPS still spreads across the cluster.\n\nNOT one shard per tenant  \u2014  1000 tenants would mean thousands of\nshards and a dead cluster.\n\ncost: a whale tenant unbalances its shard.  escape hatches are\nrouting_partition_size, or promoting it to its own index via\ntenants.index_group.\n\nshard count is FIXED at creation  \u2014  hash % N changes if N does.\nresharding = new index, reindex, swap the alias.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "el69",
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 896631051,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1892478002,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1860,
      "y": 1383.5,
      "width": 397.8,
      "height": 21.25,
      "text": "TENANT ISOLATION  \u2014  three independent layers",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "TENANT ISOLATION  \u2014  three independent layers",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "el70",
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
