      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1860,
      "y": 1415.5,
      "width": 554.4,
      "height": 122.5,
      "text": "1  gateway   X-Tenant-Id minted from the JWT, inbound stripped\n2  query     term filter on tenant_id, injected by the repo layer\n3  cache     every key is tenant-prefixed\n\nlayer 3 is the one people miss.  a key of sha1(query) alone would\nserve one tenant's results to another  \u2014  the same bug as trusting\nthe header, one layer down.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1  gateway   X-Tenant-Id minted from the JWT, inbound stripped\n2  query     term filter on tenant_id, injected by the repo layer\n3  cache     every key is tenant-prefixed\n\nlayer 3 is the one people miss.  a key of sha1(query) alone would\nserve one tenant's results to another  \u2014  the same bug as trusting\nthe header, one layer down.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
