      "type": "text",
      "x": 100,
      "y": 1665.5,
      "width": 554.4,
      "height": 105.0,
      "text": "Postgres   title, snippet and metadata all come from Elasticsearch\n           stored fields.  one datastore on the hot path.\nS3         search returns a snippet, never the file.  raw bytes\n           need a separate call:\n               GET /documents/{id}/raw  ->  302 presigned, 60 s\n           so 20 results do not become 20 S3 requests.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Postgres   title, snippet and metadata all come from Elasticsearch\n           stored fields.  one datastore on the hot path.\nS3         search returns a snippet, never the file.  raw bytes\n           need a separate call:\n               GET /documents/{id}/raw  ->  302 presigned, 60 s\n           so 20 results do not become 20 S3 requests.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    }
  ],
